      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We present the imaging findings of severe bilateral mammary duct ectasia in a postmenopausal woman. Mammographic, ultrasonographic, and magnetic resonance findings are described. Needle biopsy was used to confirm the diagnosis. Etiology, clinical significance, and management strategies for this lesion are discussed."},
